      "id": "hostpath-backup",
      "severity": "high",
      "message": "openebs-hostpath PVCs have no backup. shem proved the failure mode (3 × 40 GiB PVCs lost). Plan migration to openebs-jiva (multi-replica) or external backup for any irreplaceable data. mongodb-alpha + elohim-alpha holochain data are the highest-value targets."
    },
    {
